  "summary": "Apache HTTP Server: mod_dav_fs property database read access",
  "details": "Internal state files accessible to external parties in mod_dav_fs in Apache Software Foundation Apache HTTP Server before 2.4.69 on all platforms allows a remote client to read WebDAV dead properties of resources it cannot author via a GET request for the .DAV state directory\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache HTTP Server: from 2.4.0 through 2.4.68.",
